    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear u, but my doctor always says \"eat more vegetables\" whenever they talk about my heart health. it's kinda frustrating cuz i feel like i'm being punished for trying to be healthy. if i just try to keep it somewhat consistent, can i still go ahead and do the green smoothies? i really just want to maximize the vitamins without having to go in for more blood tests every week.",
