      "content": "Consistency in your vegetable intake is key when taking warfarin, so keeping things consistent is better than drastic changes. However, \"somewhat consistent\" is vague, and large volumes of greens can still cause fluctuations in Vitamin K levels. Please talk specifically with your healthcare provider about incorporating these smoothies so they can advise on appropriate portion sizes for *your* personal medication schedule.",
      "source": "target",
